OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe bright spells and a few showers to
OL,7,Fend the day. Further clear spells will
OL,8,Fdevelop overnight, with isolated
OL,9,Fshowers feeding through the Cheshire
OL,10,Fgap. Winds easing somewhat but
OL,11,Fremaining breezy at times. Mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FEarly showers to the north
OL,14,Fquickly fading, to leave a dry day
OL,15,Fwith variable cloud and some sunny
OL,16,Fintervals. Feeling quite warm in the
OL,17,Fwesterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
