OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FThe
OL,6,Fweather looks mostly dry and settled
OL,7,Fduring the period. There will be
OL,8,Fplenty of sunshine, and it will feel
OL,9,Fincreasing warm again in the lighter
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
